  "description": "Quick notes as plain Markdown files: multiple notes, highlights, checklists, tables, split-view preview, search, trash, export (Markdown, HTML, text, PDF, zip). Opens from a shortcut anywhere and adds a Notes button to Zentral panel bars when the full pack's panels are present. Standalone part of Zentral Extended.",
